# ALWAYS REJECT: a modus mentis refused for good from working memory is never learned again.
#
# Examining the giant tree teaches a lesson into working memory; ALWAYS REJECT drops it and puts its
# id on the member's ignore list; examining the same tree again then teaches nothing — the id stays
# off the skills, and `skill-rejected` reports the list. `save roundtrip` proves the list survives the
# save, which is the other half of the feature (an ignore list that reset on load would teach the
# lesson again the next session, silently).
#
# At seed 42 with these flags the examine teaches gut_feeling, which nothing in the starting kit
# holds; the first `expect-no-state` pins that, so a change to the kit fails here loudly rather than
# letting the script pass on a lesson that was never learned.
#
# FLAGS: --playground --skip-childhood --debug --seed 42 --no-encounters --auto-dialogue --location-type test --location-id 0 --start-area "Test Crown" --period dawn --observe-only "Test Giant Tree" --grant-mm woodcraft --means-only woodcraft --save-path .tmp-cli-save/always_reject.json

wait
click menu New
wait mode ProtagonistCreation 20
click continue
wait mode WorldView 60
travel here
wait mode LocationInteraction 60

strategy succeed
goal examine
advance 12 180
expect-no-state skills skill gut_feeling

click keyword 0
choose 0
choose ripelore
advance 12 180
click action 0
choose 0
advance 12 180
click continue
advance 12 180
expect-verb examine
expect-state skills skill gut_feeling level=1

# Refuse it for good, from the Memory tab: it leaves the skills and goes on the ignore list.
manage Memory
select mm gut_feeling
click memory always-reject
expect-no-state skills skill gut_feeling
expect-state skills skill-rejected gut_feeling
manage
save roundtrip

# Close the segment (the footer CONTINUE), which opens a new phase on the same tree.
click button
advance 12 180
regions

# The same act again teaches nothing: no chip is shown, and gut_feeling stays unlearned.
click keyword 0
choose 0
choose ripelore
advance 12 180
click action 0
choose 0
advance 12 180
click continue
advance 12 180
expect-verb examine
expect-no-state skills skill gut_feeling
expect-state skills skill-rejected gut_feeling
save roundtrip
quit
